X11 rgb.txt
-----------

This project includes generated data derived from the X11 color database
(rgb.txt) distributed with the X.Org rgb application.

The generated data is used in: src/color/x11.zig

Upstream project:
https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/app/rgb

Upstream revision:
2b2019cabfe5697f54fde2f95c5d00395909458f

